window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Ava Wilder’s life was ordinary … until the full moon revealed the beast inside.</b></p> <p>She never imagined her quiet life as an ER nurse in Grey Falls would be shattered by the revelation that she’s a born werewolf, one whose late transformation on her twenty-fifth birthday marks her as a leader destined for more than she ever wanted. Awakening with no memory of the night before, she’s thrust into a hidden world of ancient packs, supernatural enemies, and dangerous secrets that have been kept from her since birth.</p> <p>As Ava grapples with her dual nature, her boyfriend, Dante, begins to change in ways she can’t explain, testing the limits of her trust. At the same time, Jalen Foster, the enigmatic and powerful son of the Alpha, is tasked with guiding her through the transition, but his duty soon turns into something far more complicated, an undeniable connection that threatens the very balance of the pack.</p> <p>When cunning fairies set their sights on Ava, manipulating those closest to her, she’s forced to embrace the power within her before it’s too late. Betrayal runs deep, and war is brewing in Grey Falls. Torn between love, loyalty, and survival, will she fight with the pack or carve a new path for herself?</p> <p><b>A dark paranormal romance filled with passion, betrayal, and supernatural intrigue, </b><b><i>Night of She-Wolf</i></b><b> is a story of transformation, power, and the unbreakable ties of fate.</b></p>"; 
